tps://api.github.com/repos/dmwm/WMCore/merges","archive_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dmwm/WMCore/{archive_format}{/ref}","downloads_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dmwm/WMCore/downloads","issues_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dmwm/WMCore/issues{/number}","pulls_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dmwm/WMCore/pulls{/number}","milestones_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dmwm/WMCore/milestones{/number}","notifications_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dmwm/WMCore/notifications{?since,all,participating}","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dmwm/WMCore/labels{/name}","releases_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dmwm/WMCore/releases{/id}","deployments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dmwm/WMCore/deployments","created_at":"2011-09-12T10:37:21Z","updated_at":"2025-12-08T15:46:34Z","pushed_at":"2025-12-13T03:22:13Z","git_url":"git://github.com/dmwm/WMCore.git","ssh_url":"git@github.com:dmwm/WMCore.git","clone_url":"https://github.com/dmwm/WMCore.git","svn_url":"https://github.com/dmwm/WMCore","homepage":"","size":71971,"stargazers_count":46,"watchers_count":46,"language":"Python","has_issues":true,"has_projects":true,"has_downloads":true,"has_wiki":true,"has_pages":false,"has_discussions":false,"forks_count":109,"mirror_url":null,"archived":false,"disabled":false,"open_issues_count":520,"license":{"key":"apache-2.0","name":"Apache License 2.0","spdx_id":"Apache-2.0","url":"https://api.github.com/licenses/apache-2.0","node_id":"MDc6TGljZW5zZTI="},"allow_forking":true,"is_template":false,"web_commit_signoff_required":false,"topics":["cms","dmwm","python","workload-management"],"visibility":"public","forks":109,"open_issues":520,"watchers":46,"default_branch":"master","permissions":{"admin":false,"maintain":false,"push":false,"triage":false,"pull":true}},"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dmwm/WMCore/pulls/10939","html_url":"https://github.com/dmwm/WMCore/pull/10939","diff_url":"https://github.com/dmwm/WMCore/pull/10939.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/dmwm/WMCore/pull/10939.patch","merged_at":"2022-05-11T16:05:33Z"},"body":"Fixes https://github.com/dmwm/WMCore/issues/10940\r\n\r\nThis PR provides support to include IAM token to HTTP requests. The token can be obtained via separate process, e.g. via curl, `create-iam-token.sh` script or [oidc-agent](https://indigo-iam.github.io/v/v1.7.0/docs/tasks/user/getting-a-token/), and then can be used by any HTTP client. We added appropriate `Authorization` HTTP header to `pycurl_manager`. The token itself can be provided either via file name or environment variable.\r\n\r\nFor more information please consult [Tokens in WMCore](https://github.com/dmwm/WMCore/wiki/Tokens-in-WMCore) wiki page.\r\n\r\n#### Status\r\nready\r\n\r\n#### Description\r\nWe provide a patch to pycurl manager to setup appropriate HTTP header if token is provided via configuration or environment. And, `TokenManager` module which provides different ways to obtain IAM token, either via `readToken` function or `TokenManager` class.\r\n\r\n#### Is it backward compatible (if not, which system it affects?)\r\nYES\r\n\r\n#### Related PRs\r\nHere is PR for wmcore/wmagent specs: https://github.com/cms-sw/cmsdist/pull/7647\r\n\r\n#### External dependencies / deployment changes\r\nNone","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dmwm/WMCore/issues/10939/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dmwm/WMCore/issues/10939/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}},"event":"cross-referenced"}]